        </mxCell>
        <mxCell id="i6__2" value="Functional decomposition of one directory bank (four identical banks). The module has no child instance, so the boxes are logic groups named after the RTL generate blocks, processes and registers cited in the source column. Arrows show the direction of the main data path; the lookup response returns through the response register. Valid bits, PLRU and reservation stay in flops when the payload becomes a RAM wrapper (REQ-MEM-025)." style="text;html=1;whiteSpace=wrap;strokeColor=none;fillColor=none;align=left;verticalAlign=middle;rounded=0;fontSize=18;fontColor=#000000;spacing=2;" vertex="1" parent="1" vlsit_library_sha256="15DFB183E267D2A94F8CAB316E01EB3D2E9D2F9C006DC816790A394F4123506C" vlsit_library_entry="0" vlsit_library_cell="2" vlsit_library_instance="i6">
